id: SCA-023
title: GitHub Actions workflow_run without branch filtering
category: supply-chain
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .yml .yaml
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: workflow_run
patterns:
  - regex: workflow_run:\s*$
    message: workflow_run without branch/event filtering can be triggered by any fork workflow, granting access to secrets.
fix: Always filter workflow_run by branch and conclusion. Validate the triggering workflow origin before using its artifacts.
